# Claude Code (AI agent config)
# NOTE: `*.md` above is ignored for the local task-tracker workflow, so the committed
# Claude docs must be explicitly re-included here (negations below).
# COMMITTED (shared with the team):
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/**/*.md
!.cursor/**/*.md
# (.claude/settings.json, .mcp.json, statusline.mjs and the hook .mjs files are not
#  *.md and live under .claude/ which is not ignored, so they are tracked already.
#  Likewise .cursor/ markdown — agents, skills, READMEs — is re-included above; its
#  .mdc/.mjs/.json files aren't *.md so they're already tracked.)
# IGNORED (personal / machine-local — never commit):
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
.mcp.local.json
.claude/**/__pycache__/

# Graphify Cache Files
graphify-out/
**/graphify-out/
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/converted/
graphify-out/.graphify_*
# Personal AWS learning package docs (override the broad *.md rule above)
!README.md
!TECHNICAL_ANALYSIS.md
!devops-learning/**/*.md
!FILE_INVENTORY.txt

# If this package is initialized as a NEW personal learning repo, keep company deployment/history
